Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.64,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}Hello again, hackers. Previously we've gone on
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.44,0:00:05.22,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}a journey to explore how data overflows
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.19,0:00:08.44,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}and how print functions leak useful data.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.29,0:00:10.91,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}It's time to get crafty with our exploits.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.82,0:00:12.77,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}With the same idea as before,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.57,0:00:15.30,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}data and text, ultimately numbers and electric
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.27,0:00:18.32,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}cells inside tiny transistors, we turn our
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.12,0:00:20.41,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}text into something more dangerous than the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.26,0:00:22.65,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}addresses and filler bytes last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.45,0:00:24.59,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}This time, our text turns into real
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.39,0:00:27.19,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}commands for the targeted program.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.37,0:00:29.90,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}But before we touch the dangerous idea,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.75,0:00:32.71,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}freeze the room. This is a glass-box lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.51,0:00:34.05,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}Nothing here is a real target,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.85,0:00:35.81,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}nothing here is a real payload.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.61,0:00:37.40,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}We are going to watch the concept
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.20,0:00:40.15,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}like a machine behind thick museum glass.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.54,0:00:44.63,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}Because the magic trick is not that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.58,0:00:46.87,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}text is special. The magic trick is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.75,0:00:49.01,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}that the machine does not care what
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.88,0:00:51.42,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}humans call text. To the machine,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.22,0:00:54.46,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}text is just bytes. Bytes are just numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.26,0:00:56.95,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}Numbers are just patterns of voltage.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.77,0:01:00.01,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}And instructions are also bytes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.81,0:01:02.30,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}A command is not written in lightning.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.10,0:01:03.97,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}It is not born with a crown.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.84,0:01:05.81,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}It is just a byte pattern the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.99,0:01:09.95,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}processor decides to read as an action.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.12,0:01:13.81,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}So the whole story becomes a question of attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.61,0:01:16.42,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}Where is the program looking right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.35,0:01:19.20,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}Which byte is the next byte it believes?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.22,0:01:21.70,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}Normally, your input sits politely in the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.57,0:01:23.38,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}data section of the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.24,0:01:25.52,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}It is printed, compared, copied,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.41,0:01:27.90,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}maybe rejected. It is not supposed to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.70,0:01:28.99,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}become the narrator.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.43,0:01:31.87,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}But with an overflow, we saw the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.67,0:01:34.28,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}basket does not always stay a basket.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.17,0:01:36.77,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}Too much input presses against the walls,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.73,0:01:40.60,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}the walls bend, then nearby memory starts getting touched.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.65,0:01:42.71,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}Last time, that was enough to leak
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.62,0:01:45.09,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}secrets and move numbers around.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.95,0:01:47.01,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}This time, the important thing is what
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.81,0:01:48.53,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}sits next to the input:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.43,0:01:50.46,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}not just storage, but the map of
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.37,0:01:52.28,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}where execution goes next.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.77,0:01:56.00,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}Imagine the program as a train.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.80,0:01:57.98,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}Every instruction is a station.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.91,0:01:59.93,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}The return address is the ticket that
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.76,0:02:02.19,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}says where the train goes after this
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.11,0:02:03.36,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}function is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.70,0:02:07.26,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}A normal return is boring,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.27,0:02:11.41,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}and boring is beautiful. The function finishes,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.21,0:02:13.34,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}reads its saved ticket, and goes home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.42,0:02:19.77,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}But if an overflow can smudge the ticket,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.62,0:02:21.49,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}the train may not go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.34,0:02:22.84,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}It may jump to a place the
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.64,0:02:25.33,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}original programmer never planned to visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.39,0:02:32.11,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}This is the core idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.99,0:02:34.67,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}We are not making magic commands from nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.55,0:02:36.35,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}We are arranging bytes so that the
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.15,0:02:38.83,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}program's own attention lands somewhere dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.31,0:02:46.12,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}In real machines, protections exist to make
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.01,0:02:48.44,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}that jump fail. So in our animation,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.28,0:02:50.53,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}every dangerous surface gets a guard:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.43,0:02:53.36,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}permissions, randomness, seals, and rules about where
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.36,0:02:54.85,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}execution may travel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.26,0:02:59.67,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}For this episode, we stay before the bypasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.47,0:03:01.60,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}We are learning the shape of the monster,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.40,0:03:02.41,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}not feeding it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.01,0:03:10.60,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}Now zoom in. The processor lives by
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.53,0:03:13.15,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}a tiny rhythm: fetch, decode,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.00,0:03:14.99,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}execute. Fetch the next bytes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.79,0:03:17.66,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}Decode what they mean. Execute the action.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.46,0:03:20.96,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}Then repeat, millions and billions of times.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.96,0:03:25.12,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}This loop is so fast it feels like personality.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.97,0:03:27.92,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}But underneath, it is a machine asking
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.72,0:03:31.48,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}the same question forever: what is next?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.28,0:03:33.56,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}What is next? What is next?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.01,0:03:36.20,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}A command, then, is just a byte
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.04,0:03:39.29,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}wearing the instruction costume while the spotlight
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.20,0:03:40.04,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}is on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.45,0:03:50.10,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}That is why exploit animation should not
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.90,0:03:52.60,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}show evil text turning into evil code
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.41,0:03:56.14,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}like a curse. It should show interpretation changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.01,0:03:57.97,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}Same material, different role.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.24,0:04:02.99,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}Now let's build the toy stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.21,0:04:05.66,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}On the left, input arrives as a river.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.78,0:04:08.58,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}In the middle, a small function copies
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.38,0:04:10.42,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}it into a cup. On the right,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.22,0:04:12.81,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}the return path waits like a little bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.23,0:04:17.40,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}As long as the river is measured,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.20,0:04:20.71,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}everything is peaceful. The cup fills to the line,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.65,0:04:22.26,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}the function uses the data,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.06,0:04:23.67,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}and the bridge remains dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.07,0:04:31.67,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}But if the river ignores the cup,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.47,0:04:35.20,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}pressure becomes movement. Movement becomes corruption.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.07,0:04:37.23,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}Corruption becomes a new question:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.19,0:04:39.12,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}did we only break the program,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.99,0:04:40.28,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}or did we steer it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.97,0:04:45.89,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}Most bad input just crashes things.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.69,0:04:49.13,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}That matters. A crash is not boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.98,0:04:50.88,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}A crash is the machine telling you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.76,0:04:52.80,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}something touched a part of the story
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.69,0:04:53.85,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}it should not touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.97,0:05:00.85,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}Controlled behavior is different. Controlled behavior means
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.79,0:05:03.10,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}the bad input does not merely knock
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.90,0:05:05.29,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}the train over. It changes the switch
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.20,0:05:07.05,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}while the train is still moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.79,0:05:14.59,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}This is where our visual language matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.49,0:05:16.58,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}We do not need real bytes to
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.38,0:05:19.79,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}explain real danger. We need a clear model:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.59,0:05:24.49,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}pressure reaches control data, control data changes attention,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.29,0:05:26.09,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}attention reads different bytes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.89,0:05:29.91,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}Say it again smaller. Too much text enters.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.75,0:05:32.80,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}Nearby memory changes. The program looks somewhere new.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.60,0:05:35.29,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}Bytes at the new place get interpreted as actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.40,0:05:44.89,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}And smaller again. Input becomes shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.80,0:05:47.64,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}Shape changes direction. Direction changes meaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.57,0:06:00.23,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}The phrase code execution sounds like the
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.03,0:06:02.21,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}machine is possessed. But really,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.01,0:06:05.09,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}it means the control-flow spotlight reached bytes
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.90,0:06:07.78,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}that were not supposed to be the next instructions.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.13,0:06:15.57,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}A real processor does not ask,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.41,0:06:17.13,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}did a human type this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.97,0:06:19.57,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}It asks, am I allowed to execute here,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.41,0:06:27.53,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}and what do these bytes decode to?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.85,0:06:31.92,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}Modern systems try hard to answer no.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.80,0:06:34.01,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}Data pages often say, store here,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.98,0:06:35.39,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}but do not execute here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.03,0:06:47.23,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}That is the no-execute idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.09,0:06:49.13,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}Even if bytes land in memory,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.99,0:06:52.05,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}the floor itself refuses to become a stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.28,0:07:03.94,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}Another defense is randomness. If an attacker
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.74,0:07:05.42,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}needs to guess where something lives,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.31,0:07:08.14,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}the operating system can rearrange the furniture
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.07,0:07:09.96,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}every time the program starts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.84,0:07:21.16,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}From the outside, the room becomes a shifting maze.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.04,0:07:23.61,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}The concept is simple: if you cannot
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.40,0:07:26.91,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}trust fixed locations, steering gets harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.19,0:07:36.44,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}Stack canaries add a fragile seal near
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.24,0:07:40.24,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}important control data. Overflow touches the seal,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.14,0:07:42.85,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}the program notices, and the trip ends
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.65,0:07:45.11,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}before the return ticket gets used.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.69,0:07:54.23,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}Control-flow rules go one step higher.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.03,0:07:56.06,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}They ask whether the next jump makes
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.89,0:08:07.13,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}sense compared with the program's original map.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.95,0:08:12.33,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}So when people say exploit development is a fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.13,0:08:14.25,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}this is the fight: one side tries
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.05,0:08:17.00,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}to change attention, the other side builds
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.92,0:08:19.22,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}rules so attention cannot be fooled.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.60,0:08:28.39,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}Let's return to our toy command bytes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.24,0:08:29.83,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}We will make them harmless.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.72,0:08:32.04,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}No shell, no system calls,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.94,0:08:34.97,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}no real machine instructions. Just colored cards
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.77,0:08:37.36,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}that tell a toy robot to blink,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.16,0:08:38.71,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}draw a square, and stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.63,0:08:44.90,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}The safety of the toy matters because
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.70,0:08:46.38,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}the shape is the lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.18,0:08:49.09,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}The content is not. Dangerous payload details
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.89,0:08:51.24,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}would distract from the machine truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.08,0:09:02.19,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}Now place those toy cards in the input area.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.99,0:09:05.41,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}Nothing happens yet. They are still data.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.28,0:09:08.01,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}They sit there like actors waiting backstage.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.48,0:09:17.86,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}Then imagine the return ticket gets changed
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.77,0:09:20.58,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}in our symbolic model. Not to a real address.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.40,0:09:21.55,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}Not to a real location.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.43,0:09:23.56,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}Just to the idea of backstage.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.08,0:09:34.44,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}The train follows the changed ticket.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.34,0:09:37.03,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}The spotlight moves. The sleeping cards wake
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.91,0:09:39.81,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}up because the processor is now treating
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.62,0:09:42.07,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}that area as the next thing to decode.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.70,0:09:53.02,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}Same card. Different role. One moment it is text.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.83,0:09:55.10,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}The next moment, under the wrong spotlight,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.08,0:09:56.34,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}it becomes an action.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.04,0:10:06.94,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}This is the sentence the whole episode
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.85,0:10:09.58,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}is built around: data does not execute
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.55,0:10:12.04,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}because it is evil. Data executes when
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.84,0:10:15.54,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}control flow is tricked into treating it as instructions,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.36,0:10:17.63,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}and defenses fail to stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.95,0:10:25.43,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}Now animate the vulnerable moment slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.36,0:10:27.84,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}Slower than real life. Absurdly slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.64,0:10:29.73,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}A single byte crosses a boundary it
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.53,0:10:32.00,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}was never meant to cross.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.26,0:10:42.90,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}Another byte follows. Then another.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.70,0:10:45.21,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}They are not smart. They are not angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.09,0:10:47.58,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}They are just following the copy operation
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.38,0:10:48.82,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}that failed to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.76,0:11:00.00,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}This is why bugs are mechanical.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.80,0:11:02.93,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}A vulnerability is often not a dramatic villain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.88,0:11:05.30,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}It is a tiny missing rule repeated
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.10,0:11:07.17,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}at machine speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.04,0:11:17.68,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}Then the important drawer gets touched.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.57,0:11:21.04,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}In our toy model, the return ticket ink changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.01,0:11:23.66,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}The next destination is no longer the normal station.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.43,0:11:35.86,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}The function finishes. That part is important.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.68,0:11:38.20,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}The program does not instantly teleport.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.14,0:11:40.33,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}It keeps doing normal work until the
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.13,0:11:42.58,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}moment it needs the saved return path.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.94,0:11:53.45,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}Then, at return, the corrupted direction matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.30,0:11:55.33,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}The train asks where to go,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.13,0:11:58.05,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}reads the changed ticket, and the switch moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.28,0:12:09.51,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}The spotlight arrives at the input.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.45,0:12:12.14,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}The card wakes. Decode begins.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.96,0:12:22.33,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}The toy robot blinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.25,0:12:26.95,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}Next card. Draw square. Next card.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.92,0:12:29.43,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}Stop. The processor does not know this
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.23,0:12:30.69,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}was typed by a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.67,0:12:33.12,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}It only follows the path it was given.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.69,0:12:43.43,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}That is the clean mental model.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.27,0:12:45.65,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}Overflow does not equal execution.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.55,0:12:48.43,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}Leaking an address does not equal execution.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.27,0:12:50.59,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}Crashing does not equal execution.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.43,0:12:53.11,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}Execution needs control flow to land on
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.91,0:12:55.95,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}decodable bytes in an executable place.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.61,0:13:01.85,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}Every gate can fail closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.65,0:13:03.61,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}The address can be unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.47,0:13:05.77,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}The region can refuse execution.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.83,0:13:08.43,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}The seal can break and stop the program.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.24,0:13:11.25,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}The control-flow map can reject the path.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.09,0:13:21.51,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}And in secure software, we want boring endings.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.43,0:13:24.15,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}The safest exploit animation is the one
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.95,0:13:25.92,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}where the train hits a guardrail and
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.82,0:13:27.51,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}the program says no.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.46,0:13:40.41,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}So how do programmers make the ending boring?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.47,0:13:44.42,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}They measure input. They use safe copying patterns.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.25,0:13:46.64,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}They separate code from data.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.47,0:13:50.90,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}They let compiler and operating-system defenses stay turned on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.01,0:13:57.35,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}Measuring input is the first fix because
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.22,0:13:59.56,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}it attacks the bug at the source.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.41,0:14:01.26,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}The river should never be allowed to
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.06,0:14:02.64,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}pretend the cup is endless.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.47,0:14:16.20,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}Separating code and data is the second
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.00,0:14:18.54,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}fix because it attacks interpretation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.47,0:14:21.81,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}Even if data exists, the stage refuses
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.63,0:14:23.49,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}to perform it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.60,0:14:35.36,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}Randomness attacks prediction. The room moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.24,0:14:37.92,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}The furniture moves. The attacker's map gets
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.72,0:14:40.00,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}stale the moment the process starts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.75,0:14:53.03,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}Canaries attack silent corruption. They turn invisible
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.83,0:14:55.21,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}damage into a loud alarm before the
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.01,0:14:56.58,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}return path is trusted.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.83,0:15:11.02,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}Control-flow checks attack weird travel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.82,0:15:12.74,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}They make sure the train only moves
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.67,0:15:15.63,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}along routes that belonged to the program's design.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.82,0:15:30.83,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}Now pull all of this into one living diagram.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.63,0:15:34.18,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}On the left, the bug.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.00,0:15:35.88,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}In the center, control flow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.78,0:15:39.61,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}On the right, defenses. The episode is
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.61,0:15:43.14,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}not about memorizing tricks. It is about
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.00,0:15:45.38,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}seeing the physics of execution.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.75,0:15:47.94,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}The reason this feels strange is that
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.74,0:15:51.83,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}software is abstract, but the consequences are physical.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.63,0:15:54.15,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}A bit flips. A switch changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.95,0:15:56.39,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}A processor steps somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.96,0:16:07.00,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}If you remember only one image,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.80,0:16:09.78,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}remember the spotlight. Bytes are everywhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.58,0:16:12.20,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}but only the bytes under the spotlight
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.13,0:16:14.14,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}become the next instruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.14,0:16:27.24,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}And if you remember only one defense image,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.04,0:16:29.71,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}remember the locked floor. Data can sit
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.51,0:16:32.42,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}there all day, but the floor can say,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.29,0:16:33.60,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}no stage here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.51,0:16:46.25,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}Now replay the entire episode in ten seconds,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.05,0:16:59.46,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}like a flipbook.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.23,0:17:04.46,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}First pass: the attacker's dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.28,0:17:08.05,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}Input reaches control data, control flow moves,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.99,0:17:09.57,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}bytes decode as behavior.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.03,0:17:23.62,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}Second pass: the defender's dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.42,0:17:26.22,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}Input is measured, the ticket stays clean,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.11,0:17:28.91,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}data remains data, and the train goes home.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.08,0:17:42.42,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}Both stories use the same ingredients:
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.22,0:17:59.18,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}bytes, memory, attention. The difference is whether boundaries hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.97,0:18:02.64,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}So when you hear turning text into commands,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.44,0:18:04.86,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}translate it in your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.66,0:18:08.36,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}Not wizardry. Not words becoming alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.22,0:18:10.87,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}Just bytes landing where the program's next-step
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.81,0:18:13.18,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}machinery treats them as instructions.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.26,0:18:21.86,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}And the safest way to learn it
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.66,0:18:24.14,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}is with toy commands, toy memory,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.12,0:18:26.48,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}and real respect for the boundary between
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.33,0:18:27.86,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}explanation and weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.37,0:18:42.81,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}One more close-up before we leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.66,0:18:44.07,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}Look at this byte. Alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.87,0:18:46.70,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}it means nothing. In a text viewer,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.61,0:18:48.96,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}it is a character. In a file,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.87,0:18:51.53,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}it is data. Under the instruction pointer,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.33,0:19:00.54,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}with permission, it becomes a step.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.95,0:19:04.67,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}That is the beauty and the horror of computers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.50,0:19:07.09,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}They are consistent. They are obedient.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.11,0:19:09.26,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}And if we give them the wrong path,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.06,0:19:11.22,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}they obey the wrong path perfectly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.24,0:19:26.65,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}Next time, we can use this model
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.45,0:19:30.44,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}to talk about why mitigations changed exploit history.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.24,0:19:31.93,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}Not as a bag of tricks,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.73,0:19:35.07,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}but as architectural guardrails placed exactly where
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.87,0:19:38.13,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}the chain can break.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.62,0:19:46.75,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}For now, keep the chain in your head:
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.66,0:19:50.46,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}overflow changes memory, memory changes direction,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.62,0:19:54.89,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}direction changes interpretation, interpretation becomes behavior.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.41,0:20:08.69,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}And keep the defender's version right beside it:
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.52,0:20:11.17,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}measure the input, protect the return path,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.00,0:20:13.98,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}separate data from code, verify the route.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.42,0:20:28.79,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}That is how we make the invisible visible.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.59,0:20:31.21,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}A stack becomes a shelf.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.01,0:20:33.73,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}A return address becomes a ticket.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.62,0:20:36.57,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}A processor becomes a spotlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.46,0:20:40.57,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}And text becoming commands becomes a story about attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.88,0:20:49.67,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}Thanks for watching. Stay curious,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.47,0:20:51.66,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}stay careful, and remember: the machine only
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.46,0:20:53.48,House,,0,0,0,,{\c&H009ACB8C&}> {\c&H00EEF3F1&}does what the path tells it to do.
